[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ……なるほどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... interesting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヘイッ！\u3000アンタ、何やってんの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! What do you think you're doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000ああ、カルボナーラか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? Oh, if it isn't Carbonara."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナよ。誰がパスタよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's Alvina! Who're you calling pasta!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仕事の合間に、このへんの土壌を調べてるのさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just checking the soil composition between jobs."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ドジョー？\u3000なんでまた。吐かんかい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The soil? What for? Spill it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そりゃ、井戸の水が涸れた原因を探るためさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To find out why the wells are running dry, of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこをどうにか解決できれば、商売になること\n間違いなしでしょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Solve that little problem and there's good money to be made."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわぁ。イェルカの言ってた通りだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh. Jelka was right about you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもね！\u3000アタシがちゃちゃっと解決するから！\nアンタはお役御免よ！\u3000鉱石でも採掘してなされ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, too bad! I'll have this solved in no time! You can go back to mining or whatever it is you do!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんで君が？\u3000君の仕事は案内人だろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And why would you? Aren't you just a tour guide?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん゛っ！\u3000まぁ、婉曲的表現ってやつよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh! L-let's just say I have my ways..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、魔物！？\u3000ぜんぜん気付かなかった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "M-monsters!? I didn't even notice them..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "君も脇が甘いね、ベップ。\nそんなんじゃ、聖戦士は務まらないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your guard was down too, Bepp. Not very fitting for a Sacred Knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今、シトリンが魔物より危なそうな感じがした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right now, you seem more dangerous than the monsters."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心外だなあ。僕は君たちを守ろうとしただけだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm hurt. I was just trying to protect you both."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれっ。まだまだ寄って来るよ。やだなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh dear. More are coming. How troublesome."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、私の後ろに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, get behind me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仕方ない、ここは一時的に共闘で行こ！\nねえ、シトリン！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've got no choice—let's work together! Come on, Citrine!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やーだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No thanks."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んあ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんなの倒したって、儲けにならないもん。\nそれじゃあ、あとはよろしく～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no profit in fighting these things. Good luck with that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待たんかいコラァ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! Get back here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私だけで問題ないわ。姉様は私が守る",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can handle this alone. I'll protect you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、アタシも戦うよベップ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I'm fighting too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……さっきのあいつ、すごい殺気だった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That malice from her earlier...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（もしかしたら、本当にこっちが\n\u3000やられちゃうんじゃないかって思うくらい……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It was so intense, I actually thought she might...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ、今はこっちに集中……行くよ、ベップ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh, focus on what's in front of us... Let's go, Bepp!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]